  "text": "Granted by Sense Iniquity\n\nYou gain a +2 status bonus to your Perception DC against attempts to Create a Diversion, Feint you, or Lie to you. If you Seek to locate a Hidden creature or to see through a creature's Impersonate attempt, you gain a +2 status bonus to the Perception check.",
